# two_aircraft.scn -- the shared scenario for the partition-invariance MVP.
#
# The SAME file drives both partitionings. The controller reads it once and hands
# each entity's initial conditions to whichever federate it assigns that id to:
#   K=1 (co-located):  controller assigns {1,2} -> F1
#   K=2 (split):       controller assigns 1 -> F1, 2 -> F2
# The assembled truth must be identical to the bit across the two runs.
#
# Two aircraft cruising down +x at trim speed in parallel lanes (offset on y), each
# with a small initial pitch so the linearized longitudinal dynamics visibly
# oscillate -- proof the integrator is actually running.
#
# id   pos(x y z)      vel(x y z)      pitch(rad)
1      0 500 0         200 0 0         0.02
2      0 1000 0        200 0 0         0.02
